#
# Advanced stress test for raw memory allocation primitives.
# Performs complex fragmentation patterns, deeply nested scoped allocations,
# and extensive rapid alloc/dealloc cycles to benchmark memory throughput.
# Includes elapsed time tracking per individual phase.
